Sprint 1 Test Cases: User Management

Task: S1-TST-03
Project: Hope, Inc. ERP

1. Test Cases: Add User
- TC-UM-01: Admin clicks "+ Add User" and fills in valid details -> New user account is successfully created in the system.
- TC-UM-02: Leave required fields blank during user creation -> System shows validation errors and prevents saving.

2. Test Cases: Edit User
- TC-UM-03: Admin edits an existing user's name or role -> Changes update successfully and save to the database.

3. Test Cases: Block / Unblock User
- TC-UM-04: Admin clicks "Block" on an active user -> User status turns to blocked and they are restricted from logging in.
- TC-UM-05: Admin clicks "Unblock" on a blocked user -> User status restores to active and they can log in again.

4. Test Cases: Approve User
- TC-UM-06: Admin reviews and approves a newly registered user account -> User is granted access permissions according to their assigned role.
